ML model serving > ML model serving options > Frequently Asked Questions > How much CPU and RAM/memory does Serve allocate to my model?

Please find the default allocation in the user guide pages [for Gradio
](https://serve.scilifelab.se/docs/application-hosting/gradio/) and [for Streamlit](https://serve.scilifelab.se/docs/application-hosting/other/). If you would like for your model/app to be allocated more than the default amount of resources, get in touch with us ([serve@scilifelab.se](mailto:serve@scilifelab.se)) with a motivation.
